{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36217","headline":"赠式上人 · 方干","name":"赠式上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"纵居鼙角喧阗处，亦共云溪邃僻同。\n万虑全离方寸内，一生多在五言中。\n芰荷叶上难停雨，松桧枝间自有风。\n莫笑旅人终日醉，吾将大醉与禅通。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36217.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36217","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}